he was reading a map! She should be more careful next time!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le14ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "I am so sleep-deprived! I was counting sheep until 3 a.m. when I finally closed my eyes. I woke up this morning with a bad stomach ache and an inflamed throat. My mum says that I may be airsick. That's so unlucky!", "id": 2, "time": "28700", "image": "engenn5le14ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "I have a question for you guys. Could you tell me if there is some medication I could take? What can I do to deal with this horrible jet lag?", "id": 3, "time": "45200", "image": "engenn5le14ob11re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}